      "title": "Dative articles",
      "explanation": "In the dative, der and das become dem, die becomes der, and plural die becomes den. Dative plural nouns usually add -n where possible.",
      "examples": [
        {"german": "der Bahnhof → dem Bahnhof", "english": "the train station (nominative → dative)"},
